// แปลงผลจาก AI เป็นรายการที่ตรวจสอบแล้ว (AI อ่านอย่างเดียว ตรวจ/แปลง/คำนวณทำด้วยโค้ด)
const m = $('Split').item.json;
const out = $json;
const base = { id: m.id, subject: m.subject, from: m.from };
const skip = (reason) => ({ json: { ...base, ok: false, reason } });
const CATS = ['food', 'transport', 'shopping', 'utilities', 'health', 'other'];
const r2 = n => Math.round(n * 100) / 100;
const toNum = v => {
  if (typeof v === 'number') return v;
  const x = String(v ?? '').replace(/,/g, '').match(/\d+(\.\d+)?/);
  return x ? Number(x[0]) : NaN;
};

const raw = (out.content?.parts || []).map(p => p.text || '').join('') || out.text || '';
if (!raw) return skip('ai_failed');
let d;
try { d = JSON.parse(String(raw).replace(/```json|```/g, '').trim()); } catch (e) { return skip('ai_failed'); }
if (d.is_receipt !== true) return skip('not_receipt');

const items = (Array.isArray(d.items) ? d.items : []).slice(0, 50).map(i => ({
  name: String(i.name || '-').slice(0, 160), qty: Number(i.qty) > 0 ? Number(i.qty) : 1, amount: r2(toNum(i.amount) || 0),
  category: CATS.includes(i.category) ? i.category : (CATS.includes(d.category) ? d.category : 'other'),
})).filter(i => i.amount > 0);
let total = r2(toNum(d.total));
if (!(total > 0)) total = r2(items.reduce((s, i) => s + i.amount, 0));
if (!(total > 0)) return skip('no_amount');

let date = null;
const mm = String(d.date || '').match(/^(\d{4})-(\d{2})-(\d{2})$/);
if (mm) {
  let y = Number(mm[1]); const mo = Number(mm[2]), da = Number(mm[3]);
  if (y > 2400) y -= 543;
  const t = new Date(Date.UTC(y, mo - 1, da));
  if (t.getUTCFullYear() === y && t.getUTCMonth() === mo - 1 && t.getUTCDate() === da) date = `${y}-${mm[2]}-${mm[3]}`;
}
if (!date) {   // ใช้วันที่ของอีเมลแทน
  const dt = new Date(m.date);
  if (!isNaN(dt)) date = DateTime.fromJSDate(dt).setZone('Asia/Bangkok').toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd');
}
if (!date) return skip('no_date');
if (date > $now.toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd')) return skip('future_date');

const byCat = {};
for (const i of items) byCat[i.category] = (byCat[i.category] || 0) + i.amount;
const top = Object.entries(byCat).sort((a, b) => b[1] - a[1])[0];
let conf = Number(d.confidence);
conf = Number.isFinite(conf) ? Math.min(1, Math.max(0, conf)) : 0.5;
const cur = String(d.currency || 'THB').toUpperCase().slice(0, 3);
return { json: { ...base, ok: true, vendor: String(d.vendor || '').trim().slice(0, 160) || null, date, amount: total, currency: cur,
  category: top ? top[0] : (CATS.includes(d.category) ? d.category : 'other'), items,
  ref: String(d.reference_no ?? '').trim().slice(0, 64) || null, confidence: conf } };
